{"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings"],"title":"Related Documentation","anchor":"Related-Documentation"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag"],"generated":true,"title":"Patterns","anchor":"Patterns"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch a shape to scale it. Past a threshold it pops to an enlarged size with a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spring; pinch back in and it pops home."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Preview","anchor":"Preview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"The patch","anchor":"The-patch","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Origami drives this with an ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.PopSwitch"},{"text":" — a remembered on\/off state — flipped by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a pinch and fed into a Transform Scale. There’s no helper to reach for: it maps straight","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"onto native SwiftUI, which is the reusable idea worth taking away. A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MagnifyGesture"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reads the pinch, a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@State"},{"text":" flag flips at a threshold, and a ","type":"text"},{"code":".spring","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" animates the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scale between the two states (see the State\/memory → ","type":"text"},{"code":"@State","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" row in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@State private var popped = false","","RoundedTriangle(cornerRadius: 20)","    .frame(width: 90, height: 80)","    .scaleEffect(popped ? 2 : 1)","    .animation(.spring(response: 0.35, dampingFraction: 0.7), value: popped)","    .gesture(","        MagnifyGesture().onEnded { value in","            if value.magnification > 1.25 { popped = true }","            else if value.magnification < 0.8 { popped = false }","        }","    )"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The pop is the point: a discrete state the gesture toggles, animated with a spring — not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a scale that tracks your fingers continuously.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"How it’s built","anchor":"How-its-built","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The full view sits the white rounded triangle on the magenta artboard and adds a live"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@GestureState"},{"type":"text","text":" so the shape follows your fingers mid-pinch before it settles on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"popped state. Read the source (below) for the whole thing."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Behavior","anchor":"Behavior","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Pinch out on the shape to grow it; pinch in to shrink it."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cross the threshold and it snaps to the next size with a spring, rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracking your fingers continuously."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The switch remembers its state, so a release between pinches holds the current size.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Downloads","anchor":"Downloads","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode sample"}]},{"text":" — 